####Product Requirements Document: Freeflow Flowchart Components
Refer to https://reactflow.dev for reactflow documentation
####Core Definitions
##Element (Custom Node)
A customizable React Flow node that serves as the building block for creating flowcharts in Freeflow.
##Features:
Four shape variations: Rectangle, Circle, Square, and Rhombus
Connection handles on all four sides (top, bottom, left, right)
Editable text input field that expands with content
Dynamic resizing based on content
Theme customization support
Default styling aligned with React Flow documentation
##Connector (Custom Edge)
A customizable connection between Elements with multiple display options.
Features:
Multiple edge styles: Sinusoidal (Wavy), Step, Forward Arrow, Backward Arrow, and Text Input
Right-click context menu for changing edge styles
Theme customization support
Default styling aligned with React Flow documentation
